      "date": "2026-02-11T12:30:41.000Z",
      "title": "Dividend of ₹21.00 announced",
      "body": "Shareholders will receive a dividend of ₹21.00. Ex-date: 13th February 2026 Payment date: 11th March 2026 Dividend yield will be 4.1%, which is higher than the industry average of 0.8%. Sustainability & Growth Dividend is covered by earnings (69% earnings payout ratio) but not covered by cash flows (115% cash payout ratio). The dividend has increased by an average of 23% per year over the past 10 years. However, payments have been volatile during that time. EPS is expected to grow by 35% over the next 2 years, which should provide support to the dividend and adequate earnings cover.",
